<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
<div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
    <div class="p-5 my-5 rounded" style="max-width: 900px; background-color: #f8f9fa;">
        <h2 class="text-center mb-4">Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 06 June 2025</p>
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> 06 June 2025</p>

        <h5 class="mt-4"><strong>1. Our Commitment to Privacy</strong></h5>
        <p>
            We are committed to protecting your personal information in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs).
            This policy outlines how we collect, use, store, and disclose your personal data on our reading platform.
        </p>

        <h5 class="mt-4"><strong>2. What Information We Collect</strong></h5>
        <p>We may collect the following personal information from you:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Username, email address, and password</li>
            <li>Browsing history and reading preferences</li>
            <li>IP address and device information</li>
        </ul>

        <h5 class="mt-4"><strong>3. How We Use Your Information</strong></h5>
        <p>Your data is used for:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Providing access to our digital reading services</li>
            <li>Improving user experience and recommending content</li>
            <li>Communicating important updates</li>
        </ul>

        <h5 class="mt-4"><strong>4. Disclosure to Third Parties</strong></h5>
        <p>
            We do not sell or rent your personal data. However, we may disclose information to trusted service providers located in Australia
            or overseas for operational purposes, in accordance with APP 8.
        </p>

        <h5 class="mt-4"><strong>5. Data Security</strong></h5>
        <p>
            We take reasonable steps to protect your information from misuse, interference, and unauthorised access. Your passwords are stored securely using industry best practices.
        </p>

        <h5 class="mt-4"><strong>6. Access and Correction</strong></h5>
        <p>
            You have the right to request access to the personal information we hold about you and to request corrections if it is inaccurate.
            Please contact us via the details provided below.
        </p>

        <h5 class="mt-4"><strong>7. Retention and Deletion</strong></h5>
        <p>
            Personal information is retained only as long as necessary for its intended purpose or as required by Australian law.
            You may request deletion of your account at any time.
        </p>

        <h5 class="mt-4"><strong>8. Contact Us</strong></h5>
        <p>
            If you have questions about this policy or wish to make a complaint, please contact our Privacy Officer:<br />
            Email: privacy@jbook.com.au<br />
            Mail: JBook Privacy Office, PO Box 123, Sydney NSW 2000
        </p>
    </div>
